    <http://example.org/node/chunk151> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To optimize costs while maintaining our target gross margin, our can propose the following strategies: 1. **Tiered hosting and model options**: our can offer sovereign HDS tier and European models that are more cost-efficient on the recurring side than premium high-availability tiers combined with top-tier proprietary inference. 2. **One-off project costs optimization**: By framing, designing, integrating, and managing change and training efficiently, our can minimize one-off project costs, which account for 30% of the budget over 18 months. 3. **Recurring run costs control**: our will focus on controlling hosting, inference, and other recurring costs to ensure hosting, inference, and other recurring costs remain within the allocated 70% of the budget over 5 years." ;
