    <http://example.org/node/chunk154> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components would you design to meet these requirements, and how would you ensure The solution is explainable and traceable?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk155> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the requirement of providing an intelligent assistance tool for hospital staff, I would design a solution based on our company's existing capabilities in AI and innovation. a solution based on our company's existing capabilities in AI and innovation would be built around a Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) approach, which is our company's core method for generating answers grounded in the organization's own validated documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk156> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The AI components of a solution based on our company's existing capabilities in AI and innovation would include: 1. **Hybrid retrieval**: Hybrid retrieval would enable lexical and semantic search within the hospital's internal procedures, care protocols, HAS recommendations, and applicable regulatory texts. enable would allow staff to quickly access reliable and up-to-date information. 2. **Template-guided drafting**: Template-guided drafting would assist staff in drafting clinical and administrative content, such as discharge summaries, medical reports, and patient letters." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk157> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The templates would be designed to ensure consistency and quality of the generated content. 3. **Structured extraction**: Structured extraction would enable the extraction of relevant information from clinical notes, such as medical coding (PMSI/ICD-10) for activity reporting. 4. **Action and verification suggestions**: a solution based on our company's existing capabilities in AI and innovation would provide staff with suggestions for next steps based on the context of the dossier and applicable rules." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk158> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure explainability and traceability, I would implement the following features: 1. **Source citations**: a solution based on our company's existing capabilities in AI and innovation would provide citations for the sources used to generate answers or suggestions, allowing staff to verify the information. 2. **Retrieved passages**: The system would display the relevant passages retrieved from the internal corpus, providing context for the generated content. 3. **Retrieval trace**: A record of the retrieval process would be maintained, enabling auditing and debugging. 4. **Every interaction logged**: All interactions between staff and a solution based on our company's existing capabilities in AI and innovation would be logged, allowing for a posteriori audit and analysis." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk159> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By designing a solution based on our company's existing capabilities in AI and innovation around these AI components and explainability features, our company's can provide hospital staff with an intelligent assistance tool that supports hospital staff clinical-administrative activities while ensuring transparency and accountability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk16> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must take the dossier context into account where available." ;
