        ex:hasText "Faber IA proposes an artificial intelligence solution designed to support hospital staff in hospital staff clinical-administrative activities at the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk173> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA Atelier platform, based on Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), will provide an intelligent assistance tool accessible from hospital staff work environment. an intelligent assistance tool accessible from the hospital staff's work environment will facilitate access to reliable and up-to-date information drawn from internal procedures, care protocols, and applicable regulatory texts." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk174> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA solution is built around several key components: hybrid retrieval for lexical and semantic search, template-guided drafting for clinical and administrative content generation, structured extraction for medical coding (PMSI/ICD-10), and action and verification suggestions to support dossier handling." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk175> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "These features will enable hospital staff to quickly access relevant information, improve the quality of written outputs, and reduce processing and documentation times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk176> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA prioritize data sovereignty and compliance with regulatory requirements, including GDPR and French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk177> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA hosting partner, OuraneCloud, is SecNumCloud-qualified and provides active-active redundancy across two availability zones, ensuring high availability (99.9% target) and security." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk178> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA technical architecture integrates with the existing hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI), supporting health interoperability standards such as HL7 and FHIR." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk179> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA also ensure compatibility with national frameworks like Ségur du numérique en santé, Mon espace santé/DMP, and INS (national health identifier)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk18> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must facilitate the continuity of care between professionals and services by enabling relevant information sharing, an understanding of the context of an in-progress patient pathway, and an efficient resumption of handling by another professional. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk180> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of performance, Our solution provides response times compatible with daily clinical use, with a median latency of 1.3 seconds and common single-document queries below 2 seconds at p95." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk181> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA achieve high levels of answer relevance through Faber IA model-agnostic approach, selecting the most suitable models for each task." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk182> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA has experience in managing public sector projects, including healthcare, and utilizes a hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure. a hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure ensures that Our solution meets the client's requirements while staying within budget." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk183> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The project will be conducted progressively, starting with a pilot phase on a limited perimeter (one or two departments) followed by progressive generalization to all services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk184> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA provide change management support and staff training to facilitate the adoption of Our solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

